 Attention","target":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.03206","line":53},{"title":"BLIP‑2: Bootstrapping Language‑Image Pre‑training with Frozen Image Encoders and Large Language Models","target":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.12597","line":54},{"title":"BLIP‑2 GitHub","target":"https://github.com/salesforce/BLIP","line":55},{"title":"Action Chunking with Transformers (ACT)","target":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.13705","line":66},{"title":"Diffusion Policy: Visuomotor Policy Learning via Action Diffusion","target":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.04137","line":67},{"title":"Diffusion Policy GitHub","target":"https://github.com/real-stanford/diffusion_policy","line":68},{"title":"LIBERO: Benchmarking Knowledge Transfer for Lifelong Robot Learning","target":"https://libero-project.github.io/","line":79},{"title":"RoboTwin: Robust Bimanual Manipulation Benchmark","target":"https://robotwin-benchmark.github.io/","line":80}],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"vyzuqw","at":1780716294123}},
